### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

June 8, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-31-21 for furnishing One (1) New 2021-2022 Front End
Wheel Loader With Less Than 10 Hours (Transfer Station), for the City of
Cheyenne, Sanitation Division
______________________________________________
Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) Bids were received from:
1. Honnen Equipment.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
a. Submitted Two Bid Options (Bids In Compliance, No Bid Exceptions).
2. Titan Machinery.  Windsor, Colorado.
a. Submitted One Bid Option (Bid In Compliance, No Bid Exceptions).

The bids were reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), Steven
Pauli (Sanitation), and Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance).  Their recommendation is to accept the
lowest responsive bid from Honnen Equipment, for One (1) New 2021-2022 Front End Wheel
Loader With Less Than 10 Hours (Transfer Station), Less Trade In, for a bid award amount of
$172,400.00.

Funding:
023-14-1417-43-43102 (Solid Waste Fund / Equipment)

Total $172,400.00
```

